# Read by `vp fmt` (oxfmt), which loads .gitignore and .prettierignore from the
# repo root but not the developer's global gitignore. These paths are local
# agent-tooling artifacts that live inside the checkout and are never committed,
# so without this entry `pnpm fmt:check` reports drift in files git does not
# track — which would make the gate fail differently on every machine.
.memsearch/
.claude/settings.local.json
